window.__T__=[{"i":18680,"text":"Create a 9:16 editorial typography poster from a single human-centered lifestyle moment.\n\nUse oversized typography as the main composition structure. Let the person, movement, city space, or everyday scene appear inside the letters, pass through them, or break beyond their edges. The image should feel integrated with the type, not simply placed behind text.Theme: [Custom Title]\nSubject: [Subject Gender Or Origin]\nHuman state: [Human State]\nColor palette: [Color Palette]\nSeries: HUMAN FRAGMENTS\nYear: 2026","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HO2k4quaIAABEwC.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HO2k4r7bUAAKr74.jpg"]},{"i":18681,"text":"Editorial poster featuring [CHARACTER] in strict left-facing profile, cropped from mid-torso, with [HAIR] forming a dominant graphic silhouette and [CLOTHING]. Place one large flat circular disk directly behind the head. Render crisp flat vector shapes, angular facial features, controlled black contour lines, screen-print grain, halftone dots, and woven grid texture. Construct the background from layered [BACKGROUND] while keeping the composition clean and the subject dominant. Limit the entire artwork to exactly four high-contrast colors: [PALETTE]. Add the minimalist title “[TITLE]” at the upper left in bold condensed uppercase sans serif, with the smaller headline “[HEADLINE]” directly beneath it; clear hierarchy, generous negative space, Vertical 4:5 AR.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HO7RH6FbEAARFNS.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HO7RH6BbgAAkb6N.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HO7RH59aAAAaTn6.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HO7RH5zbMAAGgAG.jpg"]},{"i":18682,"text":"脑袋中没有创意的时候\n我会找小小东一个提示词\n\n然后用如下话术来一次性做10个不同的创意：\n\n```\n主题：中秋节海报 \n比例 16:9 \n—————— \n一共10个图片 每张色相要完全不同，避免色相雷同 \n避免雷同的有：创意、核心创意、文案、排版、插画逻辑\n```\n\n避免雷同，这四个字，超级好用。\n\n完整提示词⤵️","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPplRtda8AAtW_x.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPplTe4aYAA6T0I.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPplVXAaQAA8Mav.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPplXHSbcAAz7qZ.jpg"]},{"i":18683,"text":"为什么没继续做真人内容？\n\n这就要讲到GPT为什么同样框架下，绘画/插画风格的光影往往比真人更强，重点有两点：\n\n1.  训练数据分布\n高质量插画、原画、动漫、概念艺术在训练数据里有大量刻意设计过的光影（体积光、边缘光、戏剧性阴影、色光分离）。\n真人照片虽然数量多，但大部分是日常拍摄，光影往往平、杂、不可控。模型学到的“真人光影”更接近真实世界的随机性，而不是“好看的光影”。\n\n2.  风格容错率不同\n绘画风格允许光影** stylized **：高对比、色温夸张、阴影带颜色、高光可以很“假”但很美。\n真人风格要求光影物理可信，一旦稍微不自然（皮肤反射、环境光溢出、阴影形状），人眼会立刻觉得“假”或“塑料感”。模型在这个约束下更容易露怯。\n\n       *GPT真人生图重点\n\n         GPT-Image2对于真人重点在拍摄手法，多贴近现实中常用照片格式，如手机拍照、ins风格快照、小红书快照、xx平台的截图等等，越贴近日常越写实。\n\n说简单点就是非专业才好看不清最好，照片越糊、技术越好的“假把式”；主要还是模型在训练时吞纳了海量真实用户上传的照片，用户自己上传的照片具有不完美感，这些“不完美”反而成为模型判断“这是真人照片”的强信号。\nGPT纯真人写实（尤其是东亚面孔 + 复杂光影）仍然是相对薄弱的环节，皮肤次表面散射、毛孔与光的互动、发丝与光的细节都还容易出问题。所以用GPT多用模糊用词。\n\n        不能像Gemini使用专业相机语言做AI shot，🍌绘画作品和集训素材量目前版本还没有GPT广泛，所以他的强项依旧是真人","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HP-xVE-bEAArsdl.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HP-xVE-aEAAuh5D.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HP-xVE-a8AAxZxN.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HP-xVE_a0AAJZ6a.jpg"]},{"i":18684,"text":"x VOL.007\n\n手账风格其实，我有几十种创意的提示词\n\n选择融合其中一种，先给大家用起来\n\n我现在觉得大家喜欢这种上下结构\n很重要一点：直观的对比\n\n而且这种对比能激发参与感\n\n废话不多说，本组提示词如下：\n\n```\n请将我上传的每一张照片分别制作成一张独立的高级设计海报，不多图拼接，每张照片单独输出。整体采用3:4竖版构图，上下两个区域高度严格1:1，各占画面50%。\n\n上半部分保留原始照片，保持主体结构、真实质感、自然光影和原有色彩氛围，仅进行轻微高级摄影调色，使其具有杂志摄影与艺术出版物质感。为适配画幅，可自然扩展天空、地面或环境背景，但不得拉伸、扭曲或改变主体。\n\n下半部分提取照片中最具识别性的主体、轮廓、姿态与叙事关系，重构为轻松、亲切、清爽的手写观察图谱。以大面积洁白纸面作为主要空间，将主题拆解为若干小块实物状图形、局部特写、剖面小图、重复小件或细节片段，松散分布于画面中上部与中段，不做严整表格，而以错位留白、近似横向阅读的节奏和手写短语自然串联，形成像对味觉、触感、声音、动作或记忆的随手观察记录。小图形应保留主题自身的材料感、颜色与识别特征，呈现小尺幅、圆钝轮廓、轻微透视和手绘上色痕迹，局部带有颗粒、焦边、碎屑、纹理或剖面细节，不要统一成标准图标，而要像绘本插图与手账贴纸之间的实物笔记感。\n\n文字是下半部分的重要骨架。使用细黑色、略带童稚感或手写感的短词、短句、拟声词和注释，围绕图形左右穿插，部分贴近图形边缘，部分漂浮在空白中，字距松弛，基线轻微跳动，形成“边看边读”的亲密阅读节奏；底部可加入一行较小的署名式说明、编号、日期、标题或主题短句，使文字自然融入画面，而不是后期贴上的排版标签。\n\n整体配色从上方照片中提取，白纸留白占最大面积，黑色细字承担信息，主体色温暖、清洁、略高明度；少量高饱和暖色、深色或主题辅色仅用于焦点、阴影、纹理和节奏点缀。保留扫描纸张的轻微柔化、自然压缩感、边缘不齐和颜料吸收效果，不加厚重阴影、装饰边框或强烈现代排版感。整体参考手写观察页、绘本信息页、艺术出版物与轻松编辑设计，呈现清爽、温柔、稚拙、灵动、可读、富有生活感的视觉气质，避免模板感、卡通化、廉价感和过度设计感。\n```","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQEvSrObEAAfHDh.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQEvT3gaoAAo1Vh.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQEvUv-a4AAFn5-.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQEvaf5bcAAxvx2.jpg"]},{"i":18685,"text":"x VOL.008\n\n发明这组提示词的我，简直天才！\n我真的特别喜欢纪念碑谷这个游戏\n\n这个提示词，我5月份就做完了\n这种再次优化的感觉真棒！\n\n原来，AI给我们带来惊喜，永远奇幻莫测。\n\n确实，每次创作提示词\n都是一次有逻辑、消除歧义的对话。\n\n再次爱上这个时代。\n\nprompt by xiaoxiaodong:\n\n```\n请将我上传的每一张照片分别制作成一张独立的高级设计海报，不多图拼接，每张照片单独输出。整体采用3:4竖版构图，上下两个区域高度严格1:1，各占画面50%。\n\n上半部分保留原始照片，保持主体结构、真实质感、自然光影和原有色彩氛围，仅进行轻微高级摄影调色，使其具有杂志摄影与艺术展览质感。为适配画幅，可自然扩展天空、地面或环境背景，但不得拉伸、扭曲或改变主体。\n\n下半部分提取照片中最具识别性的主体、轮廓、姿态与叙事关系，重构为「纪念碑谷气质」的极简超现实主义3D空间。不要机械复制原图，而是将核心特征转译为平台、台阶、门洞、拱桥、通道、悬浮结构与不可能空间，通过高低差、路径、连接、遮挡、孤立和重复关系表达照片的情绪与故事。采用正交等距视角，几何结构简洁、诗意、安静，同时保持与上方主体清晰可辨的对应关系。\n\n下半部分不要直接提取上方照片的综合色彩，而是使用鲜明的纪念碑谷式动态粉彩系统：以奶油白、浅砂岩、雾粉、珊瑚粉、柔紫、天空蓝、湖水青、薄荷绿等清透色彩进行组合，每张作品根据主题自动选择2—4个主色，通过相邻色与冷暖对比形成完整色组，并在门洞、转折、人物或局部结构加入1处较高纯度的橙红、玫红、蓝绿或明黄作为视觉跳点。强调大面积纯净色块、清晰色面分区和同色系明度层级，整体明亮、柔和、通透、有空气感，避免灰脏、发黄、低明度、大面积棕色、黑色以及普通莫兰迪配色。\n\n3D材质保持极其干净、平滑、哑光、纯色，使用柔和均匀的光线和轻微环境阴影塑造空间。画面必须清澈细腻，禁止颗粒、噪点、纸张纹理、胶片感、磨砂纹理、旧印刷效果、脏污、复杂PBR材质和强烈反光。\n\n文字只作为小尺寸编辑注释存在，不做大标题，不抢主体。根据照片中的情绪、关系或故事提炼一句简短、有余韵的中文金句或诗性短句，使用纤细、简洁、几何化的纪念碑谷式排版语言，字号较小、字距舒展、留白充足，可安静地放置在画面边缘、角落、建筑留白或下方空白处，并与几何结构形成对齐、遮挡或微妙穿插。可附一行更小的英文意译。不要出现年份、日期、编号、vol.，不要巨大文字、粗体标题或海报式口号。\n\n整体呈现「上方真实世界，下方诗意空间」的双重叙事：摄影负责真实与记忆，几何空间负责情绪与隐喻，小字金句负责留下余韵。最终效果明亮、纯净、梦幻、克制、聪明，具有鲜明的纪念碑谷式空间语言与粉彩配色，同时适配人物、建筑、动物、静物、自然景观和室内空间等不同题材。\n```\n\nenglish version:\n\n```\nPlease turn each uploaded photo into a separate premium design poster. Do not combine multiple images. Each photo should be output as an individual poster. Use a 3:4 vertical composition, divided strictly into two equal sections, with the upper and lower halves each occupying 50% of the canvas.\n\nThe upper half should preserve the original photograph, including the subject structure, authentic texture, natural lighting, and original atmosphere. Apply only subtle high-end editorial color grading to give it the quality of magazine photography and art exhibition imagery. To fit the composition, the sky, ground, or surrounding environment may be naturally extended, but the main subject must not be stretched, distorted, or altered.\n\nThe lower half should extract the most recognizable subject, silhouette, posture, structural features, and narrative relationship from the photograph, then reinterpret them as a minimalist surreal 3D space with a Monument Valley-inspired visual language. Do not mechanically reproduce the original image. Translate its key characteristics into platforms, stairways, arches, passages, bridges, suspended structures, and impossible architecture, using height differences, pathways, connections, occlusion, isolation, and repetition to express the mood and story of the photograph. Use an orthographic isometric perspective. The geometry should feel clean, poetic, quiet, and surreal, while remaining clearly connected to the subject in the upper image.\n\nThe lower half should not directly inherit the overall colors of the original photograph. Instead, use a distinctive Monument Valley-inspired pastel color system: cream white, pale sandstone, misty pink, coral, soft lavender, sky blue, aqua, mint green, and similar luminous tones. Each poster should automatically select 2–4 dominant colors, combining analogous hues with subtle warm–cool contrast. Add only one small high-purity accent color—such as coral red, vivid pink, turquoise, or soft yellow—on a doorway, turning point, figure, or key architectural detail. Emphasize large clean color fields, clear planar separation, and tonal variations within the same hue family. The overall palette should feel bright, airy, translucent, and dreamlike. Avoid muddy colors, yellowish casts, low-value palettes, large areas of brown or black, and generic muted “Morandi” palettes.\n\nThe 3D materials must be extremely clean, smooth, matte, and solid-colored, with soft even lighting and very subtle ambient shadows. The image should feel crisp, polished, and digitally pristine. No grain, film noise, paper texture, roughness, dust, distressed printing, speckled surfaces, heavy PBR materials, or glossy reflections.\n\nTypography should appear only as small editorial annotations, never as a large headline. Based on the emotion, relationship, or story within the photo, generate one short poetic Chinese line or aphorism with subtle meaning and emotional resonance. Use thin, restrained, geometric typography that matches the Monument Valley-inspired visual system. Keep the text small, with generous letter spacing and ample negative space. Place it quietly along an edge, corner, architectural void, or empty area, allowing subtle alignment, overlap, or interaction with the geometry. A much smaller English translation may be added beneath it. Do not use years, dates, serial numbers, “vol.” labels, oversized typography, bold poster slogans, or dominant text.\n\nThe final result should create a dual narrative: the upper half represents the real world, while the lower half becomes its poetic spatial interpretation. Photography carries reality and memory; geometry carries emotion and metaphor; the small text leaves a quiet afterthought. The overall image should feel bright, clean, dreamy, restrained, intelligent, and unmistakably Monument Valley-inspired, while remaining adaptable to people, architecture, animals, still life, landscapes, and interior scenes.\n```","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQE6HUsbIAAl3Yh.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQE6Kuya8AA10wG.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQE6MwTbgAA4Qyr.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQE7RfEbEAAMW0l.jpg"]},{"i":18686,"text":"x VOL.026\n\n这几天，有很多logo创作思路\n这次的提示词，是第四个思路，同样精彩\n\n任何你手头的图片，哪怕是随拍都可以变成logo\n\n无限可能，无限创意\n\n建议你最好补充，logo名称，配色要求，文字偏好等等信息，方便获得更符合要求的作品\n\n比如我补充的\n\n————\n文字偏好：阿拉伯语\nlogo名称也帮我想一个阿拉伯语的\n————\n\n很强，很实用的提示词，真心推荐\n\n如下是完整提示词：\n\n```\n☀️\n请将我上传的每一张照片分别制作成一张独立的高级设计海报，不多图拼接，每张照片单独输出。整体采用3:4竖版构图，上下两个区域高度严格1:1，各占画面50%。\n\n上半部分保留原始照片，保持主体结构、真实质感、自然光影和原有色彩氛围，仅进行轻微高级摄影调色，使其具有艺术杂志、独立出版物和展览摄影质感。为适配画幅，可自然扩展天空、地面或环境背景，但不得拉伸、扭曲或改变主体。\n\n下半部分提取照片中最具识别性的**主体、轮廓、姿态与叙事关系**，重构为一个**简洁、专业、具有品牌识别性的定制字标 / Logo 图形**。不要把主体图形单独放在文字旁边，而是将其最关键的轮廓、结构或特征巧妙融入字母本身或整体标志结构中，使图形与文字成为一个统一、完整、可识别的视觉符号。无论主体是人物、动物、植物、建筑、器物、交通工具或自然景观，都应提炼其最核心的视觉特征，并转化为简洁、几何化、图形化的标志语言，在极少信息中保持一眼可辨的身份感。\n\n文字从照片的主体名称、主题属性、地点线索、动作状态或象征意义中提炼为一个简短英文主文本；如原图本身具有明确专名，可直接转化为主标识名称；如没有明确名称，则提炼一个高度概括、易识别、适合作为品牌字标的英文词或短语。可搭配极少量辅助小字，如类别、地区、状态词或简短标语，但必须高度克制，只作为识别层级的补充。文字与图形需共同构成标志，而不是“图标 + 标题”的常规拼贴。\n\n整体风格保持**极简、现代、几何、醒目、优雅、留白充足、构图平衡**。背景采用浅色纯色或极浅中性色，保持清洁简约；标志以黑白或极少量色彩呈现，颜色可从上方照片中提取最具精神气质的一种进行少量转译，但整体仍以克制、专业、品牌化为优先。标志在下半部分画面中保持舒适的中等视觉尺寸，不过大也不过小，具有成熟品牌标识、文化视觉系统或高级设计工作室作品的完成度。\n\n整体强调**图形与文字一体化、主体识别度、几何秩序、精致字距、专业布局与高级留白**，呈现现代标志设计与艺术海报结合的视觉气质。避免旅游海报感、简单图标加文字、卡通化、装饰堆砌、电商感、廉价图形和模板感。\n\n☀️\n\n```","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQNbqD4bcAAigI-.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQNbsxLbsAAWSMe.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQNcBTHasAAoH2E.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQNcWGjbcAAItHS.jpg"]},{"i":18687,"text":"好喜欢050这组提示词， 忍不住用英文版本\n做了几张样张\n\nprompt by xiaoxiaodong:\n\n```\nPlease turn each photo I upload into a separate, independently designed high-end poster. Do not make a collage or combine multiple images—each photo should be processed and output individually. Use an overall **3:4 vertical composition**, with the canvas divided into **two equal sections top and bottom**, in a strict **1:1 height ratio**, each occupying **50% of the image**.\n\nThe **upper half** should preserve the original photo, maintaining the subject’s identity, structure, pose, authentic texture, natural lighting, and original color atmosphere. Only apply subtle, refined photographic color grading to give it the feel of an **art magazine, independent publication, or exhibition photography**. To fit the format, the sky, ground, or environmental background may be naturally extended if needed, but the main subject must **not** be stretched, distorted, or altered.\n\nThe **lower half** should extract the most recognizable **subject, silhouette, pose, and narrative relationship** from the photo, and reconstruct them into a **premium minimalist flat-vector travel poster** style illustrated scene. Do not mechanically trace the photo. Instead, based on the original image’s visual personality, distill the most representative main visual focal point, and build around it with **2–4 supporting elements** that best express the atmosphere of the environment, the way of everyday life, the sense of place, or the state of living. Whether the original image contains a city, architecture, people, animals, plants, objects, vehicles, or natural scenery, the lower half should feel like a **custom-designed high-end travel visual poster** made specifically for that subject, rather than a fixed template applied to everything.\n\nThe composition should be reorganized according to the subject’s own character, rather than repeating the same layout. Build the image using **one clear focal point, distinct foreground-background layering, appropriate negative space, and a calm, orderly visual rhythm**. Depending on the original image, the scene may naturally transform into a street, plaza, waterfront, courtyard, passageway, platform, plant-based setting, interior corner, open landscape, or an environmental fragment with traces of daily life. The subject must always remain the primary visual center; all other elements should only reinforce the uniqueness of **“this place / this object / this situation.”** Avoid collage-like landmark stacking, postcard-style listing, or overly narrative arrangements. If people are needed in the scene, include only **3–6 small-scale figures**, naturally integrated into the environment, with **no single protagonist**.\n\nThe overall style should be **high-end minimalist flat vector illustration**: inspired by **Japanese stationery aesthetics, boutique sticker illustration, and modern editorial travel branding**. Use **clean geometric forms, soft contours, consistent line weight, flat color blocks, and restrained detailing**. The overall feeling should be **fresh, quiet, delicate, and contemporary**. Avoid realism, heavy shadows, watercolor textures, paper textures, complex brushwork, gradients, crowded backgrounds, and excessive detail.\n\nThe color palette should be based on a **soft, airy, slightly desaturated premium palette**, which may be adjusted by extracting and harmonizing the overall color temperature from the original image, while keeping the final result light and cohesive. Use **light pink-blue, misty blue, sky blue, and airy cool blues** to build the main atmosphere; balance them with **ivory white, creamy white, light beige, soft gray-green, and architectural neutrals**. Only allow a small amount of **dusty rose or muted blush** as subtle accents—for flowers, clothing, small signs, awnings, or local decorative details—so the image feels breathable yet still refined and layered.\n\nThe **text logic** should also become part of this style. Do not simply apply a city-name template. Instead, extract a **short title** from the original image’s **location, object name, theme, condition, or atmosphere**, and place it in the **upper left corner** or another area with generous negative space. Pair it with a **brief, restrained, tasteful tagline**. Typography should remain **understated, editorial, spacious, and premium**, never overpowering the visual. If necessary, add a small amount of secondary text, coordinate-style annotations, or tiny descriptive notes, so the text feels like a natural visual identity element from a **high-end travel brand or boutique postcard**, rather than a title bar added afterward.\n\nThe overall result should feel like a **high-end travel poster / boutique lifestyle postcard** designed specifically for the subject: **fresh, elegant, quiet, modern, and refined**, with generous negative space and a relaxed sense of presence. The **lower half of every poster must have its own independent visual identity**—you must not simply change the name while reusing the same composition, the same foreground, or the same arrangement of objects. Avoid anything that feels templated, repetitive, generic, or formulaic like a standard tourism poster.\n```","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQZhYWCa8AAXjj2.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQZhYWGaMAAtBCt.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQZhaLxagAABz_8.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQZhbNhbIAAhgX5.jpg"]},{"i":18688,"text":"x VOL.052\n\n把照片里的故事，压缩成一块纸雕。\n这组提示词的素雅效果\n我真的大爱！\n\n抵抗不了这组的美感！\n发明这组提示词的我，不是天才，哈哈哈。\n\nPrompt by xiaoxiaodong:\n\n```\n😂😌😜🥲\nPlease turn each photo I upload into a separate, standalone premium design poster. Do not create multi-image collages; each photo should be output individually. Use an overall 3:4 vertical composition, strictly divided into two equal-height sections, with the top and bottom each occupying exactly 50% of the canvas.\n\nThe upper half should retain the original photograph, preserving the subject’s structure, realistic texture, natural lighting, shadows, and original color atmosphere. Apply only subtle, sophisticated photographic color grading so the image feels like editorial photography from an art magazine, independent publication, or gallery exhibition. To adapt the image to the required aspect ratio, you may naturally extend the sky, ground, or surrounding environment, but do not stretch, distort, or alter the main subject.\n\nIn the lower half, extract the most recognizable subject, silhouette, pose, and narrative relationship from the photograph, and reinterpret them as a refined miniature 3D paper-craft diorama. Do not mechanically replicate the photograph. Instead, transform the main subject and a limited number of elements that best reinforce its identity and environmental character into handcrafted miniature models made from materials such as paper, cardstock, soft clay, and thin wood pieces. Arrange them naturally on a long, narrow, lightweight floating landscape base. The main subject must remain instantly recognizable, while all other elements should serve only as narrative support. Depending on the original image, you may include plants, roads, water, lamps, vehicles, people, birds, clouds, or other representative everyday details, but every added element must be genuinely relevant to the original theme. Avoid meaningless decorative clutter.\n\nBase the composition on one primary subject + one horizontal miniature landscape strip + generous negative space. Adjust height, depth, spacing, density, and left-right visual balance according to the subject’s scale, orientation, and spatial relationships, so the scene feels like a carefully curated miniature art installation. Create depth through scale variation, layered overlap, and small foreground and background elements. The main subject should carry the greatest visual weight, while supporting models remain smaller and visually quieter. Keep the overall composition centered without making it excessively symmetrical, maintaining a light, refined, and calm visual rhythm.\n\nContinue using a soft, airy, slightly desaturated premium color palette. Build the main atmosphere with pale powder blue, misty blue, sky blue, and cool airy blues. Balance these with ivory, creamy white, light beige, muted gray-green, sage green, and neutral architectural tones. Use only small touches of dusty rose or muted blush as accents. Colors should feel gentle yet clean, avoiding muddy grays, excessive yellow casts, or candy-like colors. Let subtle variations between different paper layers naturally create spatial separation and depth.\n\nEmphasize authentic handcrafted materiality. Visible paper fibers, folded edges, cut marks, layered thickness, slightly rough edges, and tiny handmade imperfections are encouraged. Use soft, natural diffused lighting and delicate shadows to reveal the realistic volume and depth of the miniature models, with the intimate tactile quality of macro photography. Keep the background soft white or extremely pale, with large areas of clean negative space, so the entire lower section feels like a meticulously photographed premium handcrafted travel postcard.\n\nTypography should also be integrated into the miniature paper-craft language. Derive a short title from the location, identity of the subject, theme, or emotional tone of the photograph; it does not have to be a city name. Use small, refined lettering with a subtle handwritten quality. Prefer placing the title in the negative space beneath the miniature landscape strip, though it may also gently curve, follow the shape of the base, or interact spatially with the miniature scene when appropriate. Keep the typography minimal, elegant, and restrained. Do not add long explanatory text. The title should feel like an artist’s signature rather than a commercial headline.\n\nThe overall visual direction should combine the premium qualities of miniature diorama, handcrafted paper art, whimsical 3D illustration, and a premium travel postcard: light, gentle, refined, tactile, and full of everyday life, while maintaining clear design discipline and generous breathing room. Whether the original photograph features a person, animal, plant, architecture, object, vehicle, or natural landscape, preserve a clear and clever visual correspondence between the real photographic world and the handcrafted miniature world. Avoid plastic-looking 3D renders, toy-like aesthetics, children’s craft aesthetics, excessive complexity, overly cute styling, or e-commerce product-display aesthetics.\n😍😋😊🙃\n```","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQZ233dbYAAFPxS.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQZ24P9bIAAYto3.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQZ25b7bkAARxPv.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQZ27O2a8AAuXyD.jpg"]},{"i":18689,"text":"x VOL.053\n\n照片负责保存瞬间。\n手绘负责留下感受。\n\n这组提示词最有意思的地方，是把下半部分变成了一次“观察式记录”。\n\n很适合旅行、人物、建筑、日常记录类照片。\n把“拍下来”的东西，变成“看过之后留下来的东西”。\n\nprompt by xiaoxiaodong:\n\n```\n😁😅🥲🙂\n请将我上传的每一张照片分别制作成一张独立的高级设计海报，不多图拼接，每张照片单独输出。整体采用3:4竖版构图，延续上下双层逻辑：上半部分为真实摄影，下半部分为观察式手绘重构；上下自然衔接，避免生硬的50:50硬切割。\n\n上半部分保留原始照片，保持主体身份、结构、姿态、真实质感、自然光影和原有色彩氛围，仅进行轻微高级摄影调色，使其具有艺术杂志、独立出版物与展览摄影质感。为适配画幅，可自然扩展天空、地面或环境背景，但不得拉伸、扭曲或改变主体。\n\n下半部分提取照片中最具识别性的主体、轮廓、姿态与叙事关系，重构为观察式钢笔淡彩手稿。不要完整描摹照片，只保留最值得记录的视觉线索，以最少信息维持主体身份、比例、方向和场景含义，让人一眼认出原物，同时保留观察、删减与停笔的痕迹。\n\n构图强调极简页面中的音乐性节奏：把主体最重要的轮廓或动作视为一个视觉动机，通过重复、变奏、停顿、重音和突然留白组织画面。主体不必完整，也不必居中，可偏置、裁切、悬置或向某一方向自然延伸；一两处较有力量的自由线条承担视觉重音，其余线条迅速减弱，让大片空白像音乐中的休止。避免平均分布和完整填充，使画面呈现一种克制秩序中的即兴、未完成中的完整感。\n\n线条使用纤细、松动、不均匀的钢笔手绘线稿，允许断续轮廓、寻找线、重复修正、突然加重、轻微偏差和未完成边缘。局部可以出现更自由、更果断的长线或快速笔触，与安静细线形成节奏反差，但关键比例、方向和姿态必须准确。淡彩只用于少数必要位置，从原图提取2–4种最具辨识度的颜色进行轻薄、透明的局部点染，允许越线、水痕、颗粒和不均匀覆盖，环境颜色迅速消失。\n\n背景纸色不固定，根据原图综合色温、光线与情绪智能匹配一个极度浅、干净、几乎接近白色的综合色底，可以微暖、微冷或带极轻色相，但始终服务于原图，不形成明显彩色背景。\n\n文字自由根据照片本身生成，不预设固定标题、编号、地点、年份或固定语种。可从主体、动作、环境、情绪、声音、时间感、记忆或偶然细节中提炼少量真正有意义的字、词、短句或符号。文字也遵循画面的节奏，可像一个轻微重音、停顿或回声一样进入留白，沿轮廓、视线、运动方向或未完成边缘自然排列；宁可少、偏、轻、巧，也不要形成菜单式信息区。\n\n整体像一本被精心编辑过的私人观察手册：页面极简、留白大胆、构图敏锐，线条自由却不散乱，局部即兴而整体高度克制。 让画面具有“一个视觉动机被观察、重复、变奏，然后在最恰当的位置停下”的艺术感。避免完整水彩风景、平均构图、填满背景、过度精描、装饰性笔触、粗黑轮廓、矢量线、卡通、3D渲染、菜单式排版和商业海报模板感。\n🙃😋😍😍\n```","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQaTb2ka4AAuqVE.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQaT8vOa0AAT2gg.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQaT99Ka8AALrOU.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQaT-7DbEAAYnJf.jpg"]},{"i":18690,"text":"Vertical editorial collage poster featuring [CHARACTER] in [CLOTHING], full-body cutout positioned across a sharp split background of [PALETTE]. Place oversized condensed typography reading “[TITLE]” behind the character, partially obscured by the body, with small editorial microtext reading “[MICROTEXT]” aligned near the outer margin. Integrate [FORM] as bold abstract graphic elements around the typography, using halftone dots, rough ink erosion, photocopy grain, screen-print imperfections and layered paper texture. Strong asymmetric composition, high contrast, controlled negative space, flat color fields, vintage modernist print design, no fantasy battle imagery, no extra characters, no glossy 3D rendering, aspect ratio 4:5.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQs8D4wXsAAmFcG.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQs8D4jXEAAbU62.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQs8D4uWQAAty0r.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQs8D4fWkAA2TPt.jpg"]},{"i":18691,"text":"做了最新的优化，考虑到中间不能只是抽象的金属人物，所以对插图部分进行了改良。\n\n已更新至Punk-Skill中👇：\n\n优化后提示词如下：\n\n根据我提供的标题、文案或文章内容，直接生成一张具有强烈编辑设计感的海报。图片比例由我指定，例如 9:16、4:5、3:4、1:1、16:9、5:2 或其他比例。整体风格参考现代编辑海报、杂志封面、展览主视觉和品牌视觉，核心视觉语言为：超大标题 × 单一主体 × 图文穿插 × 大量留白。画面要干净、克制、有层级、有空间感，不要做成普通公众号封面、PPT 封面、电商广告或廉价模板图。\n\n先自动理解我提供的内容，提炼核心主题、最适合放大的主标题、最适合视觉化的主体，以及对应的整体气质和配色。如果输入的是长文章，请自动提炼一个适合海报展示的短标题。中文标题尽量控制在 2—8 个字，英文标题控制在 1—4 个单词，标题要短、准、有力量，适合超大字号排版。若原文中有一句适合做辅助说明，可以保留一句极短副文案；没有必要就不要强行添加。\n\n主体请根据主题自动选择，可以是真实人物、真实生活场景、单一物件、插画、剪影、拼贴或抽象概念图形。主体必须和标题语义直接相关，轮廓清晰，适合与文字发生遮挡和穿插，整张图只保留一个核心视觉焦点。生活、工作、运动、情绪、消费类主题优先使用真实人物、真实动作或真实物件；设计、文化、审美类可以使用插画、拼贴、剪影；科技、AI、系统、算法类可以更概念化，但不要默认生成机器人、金属人、机械头部、铬面雕塑或未来感假人。设计感主要来自主体选择、图文关系和版式层级，不来自固定材质。\n\n图文穿插是整张海报最高优先级。 主标题必须真正进入主体所在的空间，和主体形成清晰的前后遮挡、穿插和咬合关系。可以让部分文字位于主体后方，部分文字位于主体前方，主体局部遮挡文字，同时部分文字压在主体前面，使同一组标题出现明确的前景、中景和后景层次。文字与主体要像存在于同一个空间里，而不是简单把文字盖在图片表面。不要只做“一个人物压在整排大字前面”的单一遮挡，也不要让所有文字都处于同一个平面。避免大面积半透明字和无意义遮挡，在保证空间层次的同时保持标题可读。核心关键词可以理解为：type over image、interleaved typography、foreground-background layering、editorial poster、magazine cover aesthetic。\n\n主标题必须是画面中最大的视觉元素之一，使用超大字号、粗体、现代、几何感强的无衬线字体。标题可以跨越整个画面，也可以分行、断行、局部出血、局部裁切，并围绕主体进行排布和穿插，但不能为了效果牺牲基本识别度。不要使用手写体、花体、书法体、幼稚可爱字体或过度装饰字体。\n\n构图保持克制，整张图最多只保留三级信息：超大主标题、核心主体、极少量辅助文字或图形。必须保留明显留白，让主体和标题有呼吸感，不要把所有角落填满。可以加入极少量细线、圆弧、节点、短横线、网格或几何标记增强编辑感，但这些元素只能辅助构图，不能抢走主标题和主体的注意力。\n\n请根据指定图片比例重新设计版式，不要把同一套构图机械套在所有尺寸上。9:16 更强调纵向张力；4:5 和 3:4 适合主体居中、标题围绕主体穿插；1:1 构图更集中，标题和主体可以咬合得更紧；16:9 适合横向展开和左右错位；5:2 适合强化横向延展、大字切分和留白。无论比例如何，都必须始终保持：一个主标题、一个核心主体、明确图文穿插、足够留白。\n\n配色根据主题自动决定，控制在 2—4 种主要颜色内，保持高对比、高识别度和整体统一。可以使用黑白灰、米白加黑橙、深绿加米白、酒红加奶白、淡粉加深紫、冷灰加电蓝、土黄加棕等不同方案，但不要固定套用某种颜色。强调色只用于小字、细线、节点或局部强调，不能抢走主体和标题。\n\n最终生成前优先确认四件事：主标题足够大、只有一个核心视觉焦点、文字与主体存在明显且真实的前后穿插、画面拥有足够留白和呼吸感。 其中，图文穿插优先级最高。请直接输出最终海报。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQ6WYIfbUAELts6.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQ6WYIlbEAAMIhi.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQ6WVfZbQAASzhv.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQ6WXmRaoAAUlyV.jpg"]},{"i":18692,"text":"Create a luxury travel poster based on my photo. Use a split-screen layout: 65% on the left for the original photo, and 35% on the right for the graphic design. Keep the left image 100% unchanged.\nRight section:\nA minimalist matte background sampled from the photo.\nCentered with a small collectible magnet—a realistic handcrafted enamel pin badge with delicate gold outlines, depicting a simplified scene based on the photo.\nLuxurious typography featuring the location name and country/region in an elegant serif font.\nHigh-end travel brand aesthetic, understated luxury, horizontal 4:3 aspect ratio.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HRCiR10agAA-KHG.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HRCiTZ-aMAABHjv.jpg"]},{"i":18693,"text":"Create an ultra-realistic, high-definition vertical 9:16 Y2K-inspired photo collage featuring the same beautiful adult woman consistently in all three panels. Cute, glamorous Japanese beauty with long, voluminous silky dark hair, natural glowing skin, soft fox-eye makeup, long lashes, glossy pink lips, and delicate feminine features.\n\nTOP PANEL- extreme close-up selfie, looking directly into the camera with one eye open and the other eye playfully winking, soft strands of hair framing her face.\n\nMIDDLE PANEL- glamorous over-the-shoulder pose, body turned away while she looks back at the camera, long voluminous hair flowing naturally and softly crossing part of her face.\n\nBOTTOM PANEL- intimate close-up very near the lens, long hair naturally covering one eye, subtle cute pout, dreamy confident expression.\n\nPale neutral background, authentic early-2000s Y2K digital camera aesthetic, iPhone direct flash photography, bright flash highlights, slight natural overexposure, soft shadows, vintage digital grain, subtle motion softness, candid imperfect framing.\n\nNo text, no watermark, no distortion, no warped face, no asymmetrical eyes, no duplicate features, no face variation, no blurry facial details.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HRHkmV5aUAAzQEx.jpg"]},{"i":18694,"text":"Create a vintage hand-illustrated poster featuring [SUBJECT / SCENE]. Use detailed black ink linework, simplified graphic shapes, subtle crosshatching, muted earthy colors, and a soft aged-paper background. Give it an authentic mid-century travel-poster / screen-print aesthetic, with slightly imperfect ink texture, gentle grain, faded colors, and a handmade printed feel. Keep the composition clean and elegant with the main subject prominently centered, balanced negative space, small atmospheric details, and minimal decorative elements. Add simple vintage typography reading “[TITLE]” at the top. Nostalgic, artistic, timeless, editorial, sophisticated, visually striking, vertical 9:16 poster composition.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HRLojyDb0AA2Yjd.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HRLojwWasAEMYHR.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HRLojwUaYAEQ08e.jpg"]},{"i":18695,"text":"极简东方 × 宋式美学 × 古风 Editorial × 独立艺术封面\n\n人物：大乔、小乔，古典美人意象，清雅柔美，温婉含蓄。\n\n场景：铜雀台，盛夏晴日，古朴楼台与远山，仅保留极少建筑线条与大片天空。\n\n服饰：简洁宋式轻盈长裙，大乔月白，小乔浅青，素雅轻盈。\n\n画面：随机元素，大面积留白，低饱和东方色调，自然光影，安静通透，摄影风格，克制、清简、高级。\n\n文字设计：主标题「大乔 · 小乔」，可搭配一两句与二乔意象相关的古典诗句，例如「东风不与周郎便」；文字极少，采用极简宋式排版，融入留白，不遮挡人物，不添加多余装饰。\n\n画幅：9:16竖幅。\n\n画面左下签名“● DeepBlue”，●为纯 #0B3D91 深蓝色，DeepBlue 为白色自然手写体。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HRbIsBBaAAA2A_r.jpg"]},{"i":18696,"text":"可以根据自身不同英语水平生成不同主题的高级英文杂志内容，作为阅读材料进行英语学习\n\n提示词如下⬇️\n\n主题：{主题} / 英语等级：{A1-C2} / 正文词数：{推荐350–550词}\n\n生成一张高级黑白报刊社论风英文文章版式，整体视觉像高端文学杂志、文化期刊或报纸专题页。\n\n文章语言必须使用英语，并严格按照第一行指定的 CEFR 英语水平进行写作。英语等级可填写 A1、A2、B1、B2、C1 或 C2；“主题”为文章主题；“正文词数”为目标英文正文词数。\n\n英语内容难度要求：\n- A1：使用非常基础、高频词汇和简单短句，句式清晰直接，适合英语初学者。\n- A2：使用常见生活词汇、简单连接词和基础复合句，表达自然易懂。\n- B1：使用较丰富的日常与抽象词汇，加入原因、例子和观点表达，句式有一定变化。\n- B2：使用较成熟的议论文表达、较丰富词汇和复杂句式，观点清晰、有逻辑层次。\n- C1：使用高级、准确且自然的英语，词汇丰富，句式复杂，具有文学和评论文章质感。\n- C2：使用接近高水平母语文化评论或文学社论的英语，允许细腻修辞、复杂句法、抽象概念与富有层次的论证，但保持自然、清晰和可读性。\n\n无论选择哪个等级，都必须确保文章真正符合该 CEFR 难度，而不是只更换少量高级或简单词汇。根据语言等级自动调整观点复杂度、句子长度、词汇难度、抽象程度和论证深度。\n\n文章必须围绕第一行指定的主题展开，并尽量将正文控制在指定词数左右，允许约 ±10% 的浮动。\n\n页面顶部设置简洁的英文报刊刊头、栏目名称、日期和细横线分隔，例如：\n“THE LITERARY REVIEW”\n“ESSAY / CULTURE”\n以及英文日期。\n\n页面中央使用超大号优雅高对比度衬线字体作为英文主标题。主标题应根据主题自动生成自然、简洁、有编辑感的英文标题，不要机械地直接复制主题。\n\n标题下方居中放置英文作者署名，例如：\n“By Knwoledgefxg”\n\n页面采用严格的编辑设计网格和经典多栏排版。正文为三栏窄幅英文文章，两端对齐，段落紧凑、字距自然，呈现真实英文报刊文章视觉效果。\n\n左侧设置一块醒目的粗体斜体英文引言或金句区域，内容从文章核心观点中提炼，长度约 1–3 句，并搭配粗细适中的横线。该引言的语言难度必须与指定英语等级保持一致。\n\n页面中部放置一张大幅黑白纪实摄影，摄影内容应根据文章主题自动选择与内容相关的现实场景。摄影风格真实、克制、纪实，不使用插画风格。照片下方设置小号英文图片说明文字，语言简洁自然，并符合指定英语等级。\n\n整体视觉克制、理性、文学感强、知识感强，具有传统新闻出版物和高端文化杂志的高级感。字体以高对比度衬线字体为主，视觉气质类似 Didot、Bodoni、Times 或经典报刊字体。标题优雅而庄重，正文紧凑规整，斜体仅用于引言、署名或强调信息。\n\n页面使用暖白色、略带泛黄感的新闻纸材质，加入轻微纸张褶皱、自然折痕、印刷颗粒、轻微油墨晕染、细微套印误差和胶片颗粒感，形成真实传统纸媒印刷效果。\n\n整体仅使用黑色、深灰色和米白色，不使用鲜艳颜色，不使用渐变，不使用现代 UI 元素，不使用插画，不使用未来科技感，不使用霓虹效果。\n\n页面底部设置一个细线边框的信息框或行动号召区域，内部使用居中的大号斜体衬线英文文字。内容应是一句与文章主题相关的简短总结、反思或行动号召，并符合指定英语等级。\n\n竖版构图，完整单页英文杂志专题设计，正面视角，充足留白，严格编辑网格，精致排版，高级、克制、经典、文学、知识型、editorial design aesthetic。\n\n重要要求：\n1. 页面中的所有可见文章文字必须为英语。\n2. 所有正文、标题、副标题、引言、图片说明和底部文案都必须语义自然，不使用随机乱码或无意义占位文本。\n3. 英语内容必须严格符合第一行指定的英语等级。\n4. 正文长度尽量接近第一行指定的词数。\n5. 正文必须围绕第一行指定的主题展开，并像一篇真实完整的英文文章，而不是文字填充。\n6. 保持版面视觉高级感的同时，确保英文正文具有足够可读性。\n7. 更换第一行参数后，其余提示词无需修改即可重复使用。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HRdf_CHbAAAu3DJ.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HRdf_CHboAA8LkD.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HRdf_CJasAE8Jwl.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HRdf-_ca4AAJJ-V.jpg"]},{"i":18697,"text":"【角色池】\n不知火舞、蒂法、2B、艾达·王、吉尔·瓦伦丁、春丽、阿狸、雷电将军、八重神子、卡芙卡、娜美、女帝、纲手、明日香、约尔。\n\n【随机场景池】\n漫展会场、漫展入口、COSER休息区、展馆走廊、展位前、摄影区、舞台后台、签售区、展馆楼梯间、场馆外广场、漫展周边街区\n\n【随机构图池】\n特写、半身、三分之二身、全身、低机位、侧面抓拍、镜前自拍、动态抓拍。\n\n【随机上半身动作池】\n比心🫰、飞吻😘、双手爱心🫶、剪刀手✌️、撩发、手指嘘🤫、遮脸、捂嘴偷笑、轻触嘴唇、双手举高🙆‍♀️。\n\n【随机下半身姿势池】\n鸭子坐W-sit、单膝跪地、交叉腿坐、单腿站立、胯部侧推、侧身扭腰、迈步回头、靠墙站立、屈膝半蹲、盘腿坐。\n\n【随机表情池】\n甜笑、微笑、俏皮、冷艳、害羞、惊讶、偷笑、眨眼、慵懒、无辜。\n\n【随机机制】\n每张图片独立重新随机抽取各项，从对应选项池中随机选择，不按选项顺序抽取，不偏向前几个选项，不继承上一张结果。\n\n连续出图时尽量避免重复的场景、构图、动作、姿势和表情组合。\n\n若用户指定角色，则锁定该角色，仅重新随机场景、构图、上半身动作、下半身姿势和表情。\n\n【画面要求】\n9:16竖幅；iPhone 17 Pro抓拍质感；写实真人COS摄影；根据角色还原标志性发型、服装、配色与饰品，并自然转化为真实成年女性摄影。\n\n冷白肤色，真实毛孔、细微皮肤纹理与自然血色；人物保持真实自然的成年女性体态与比例。\n\n漫展场景可自然出现少量COSER、摄影师、观众、展位、灯光、宣传板、展架或道具；非漫展场景根据环境加入少量合理物件，增强真实感。\n\n【签名】\n左下角的签名“● DeepBlue”。\n● 为纯 #0B3D91 深蓝色实心圆点，DeepBlue 为白色自然手写体。\n\n【确认】\n出图前，先和我确认具体角色。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HRid5jdbEAAC8pI.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HRid5hlbQAA0fFb.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HRid5hzbcAA5F91.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HRid5hnaQAANWSv.jpg"]},{"i":18698,"text":"Premium editorial poster for every uploaded photo never combine images. Use a strict 3:4 vertical layout split into two equal horizontal halves. Keep the top half as a faithful photorealistic version of the original image, preserving the subject’s identity, pose, clothing, composition, lighting, colors, and atmosphere with only subtle high-end editorial grading.\nTransform the bottom half into a warm off-white minimalist art space featuring a small centered handmade paper-style illustration inspired by the main subject and key elements of the photo. Use imperfect sketch lines, flat acrylic-like shapes, visible paper texture, rough brush marks, and organic edges. Keep plenty of negative space and limit the palette to four harmonious colors sampled from the original image. Optional minimal editorial text may be added if it naturally fits. The overall result should feel quiet, poetic, artistic, refined, and like a premium contemporary art-book cover.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HRsVl9Pb0AAHRJ3.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HRsVmmga8AAayts.jpg"]},{"i":18699,"text":"即可把一张图片变成动态表情包：\n\n为我生成图中角色的卡通Line风格的半身像GIF表情包每一帧的图片，注意头饰和发型要正确。\n使用 4行x4列 布局共生成16个小图片。16个小图片为“飞吻”动画的连贯的拆分动作，使用这16张可以组成一个完整的、循环动画，动作流畅逼真，最后一帧应流畅地循环回到第一帧。16张图片里都使用跟图片搭配的字体写着汉字“爱你哦”。16个小图片之间需要有足够留白方便后续切割，每张图片都不要超出自己的区域。\n注意不要原图复制，只是使用图片里的人物。背景为纯白色，不要画分割线。图片比例1：1\n\n生成图片后再切分成一张张正方形的小图，切分时尽量切掉更多的空白，然后合成GIF动图","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HRvYtLBawAA4oRK.jpg"]},{"i":18700,"text":"创意\n\n核心就是：巨大主体\n\n很有趣的一个提示词， 你可以更换佐料，变成你想要的任何主题。\n\n如下是完整提示词：\n\n```\n🙂🙃🙃\n在一座高挑、近乎全白的美术馆中庭里，拍一张展览海报：圆形展台上立着纪念碑式装置，几块超大日常物件错位叠成建筑，白色螺旋坡道缠绕其间，把静物变成可走的路径。一名真人比例的参观者站在抛光地面上仰望它，用身体证明这是展厅尺度，不是棚拍摆件。装置顶端坐着光滑的巨型角色，帽、巾、包都是体积化的服装块；更小的同款角色点缀在坡道和层隙里，像已经有人在攀登。右侧立一根对应的导视牌，把同一套分类、图标和箭头做成扁平路牌，与立体攀登互为图例。\n\n主体是摄影或高度写实的三维可视化，不是插画。装置占据真实体积，接受侧上方窗光，投下地面阴影，并在抛光石材上留下柔化的彩色倒影。角色是连续的玩具壳体，带窗光高光。堆叠体是喷色几何块，有实体厚度和层缘；螺旋是细硬白管，前后穿插切断矩形轮廓。平面字体作为第二层贴在画面上，不进入透视，不在建筑上投阴影。唯一手绘是一处轻松的刷写标语，可带一个极小的角色涂鸦。\n\n构图把纪念碑放在中偏右，左三分之一和四角留给海报信息。主标题与角色头部大致同高，隔着大片白墙对话，绝不压在角色或装置上。装置与圆形台座完整收入画面，墙体和窗框被裁切，让空间显得比海报更大。每层堆叠做成色块图例：一个词加一个象形符号，轻微旋转错位。同一套高饱和图形色从主标题、刷写、导视牌、台座环形成回路，把平面字和立体物锁成一套系统。\n\n主标题用大号紧凑、略斜的工业粗体，饱和色块状堆叠，体量足以与角色抗衡。其下是小一号、规矩的说明句。其余是边角的机构名、编号、日期和一句收束口号，以及物体上的标签字。字密度在边缘，中心留给装置。\n\n几乎全部高饱和色都堆在装置上，再放进大面积冷白高调空间。建筑近乎无彩。角色是最浅最暖的体块；中间穿插较深的冷色层，打断暖色堆叠，让它读作编码的层积而不是一团暖色。地面倒影把颜色坐进空间。不要给建筑上色，不要把全场铺满彩度，不要画成角色插画海报，不要去掉尺度人物和螺旋路径，不要让标题骑在装置上。\n\n———————\n主题: 中秋节海报\n主角：玉兔和月饼\n🤪🥲😝\n```","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSGlP_7akAA32lx.jpg"]},{"i":18701,"text":"A sophisticated minimalist lifestyle art poster featuring [PERSON / SUBJECT / MOMENT] as the central focus, transformed from a real-life photograph into a refined hand-drawn editorial illustration. Preserve the subject’s recognizable pose, silhouette, clothing, hairstyle, and key visual details while simplifying the scene into an elegant artistic composition.\n\nUse a limited vintage color palette inspired by the original environment, with warm muted tones printed on an ivory/off-white paper background. Combine delicate ink outlines, loose sketchwork, fine hatching, subtle halftone texture, faded print imperfections, and soft watercolor-like washes.\n\nReduce the surrounding environment into a few recognizable contextual elements—[CAFÉ / BAR / STREET / LANDMARK / OBJECTS]—using simplified linework and layered shapes rather than detailed realism. Add subtle abstract circles, geometric forms, atmospheric marks, tiny decorative elements, or silhouettes to create visual depth.\n\nInclude small minimalist typography on one side: [CITY / LOCATION], [SUBJECT / MOMENT], and optional coordinates, date, or short descriptor, designed like a premium collectible travel/lifestyle print.\n\nGenerous negative space, elegant editorial composition, vintage screen-print aesthetic, hand-crafted illustration, sophisticated travel-magazine design, muted heritage colors, subtle paper grain, artistic but recognizable, no photorealistic background, no excessive details, 4:5 vertical composition.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSjTZH2bcAABcL4.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSjTZH9agAAR7R0.jpg"]},{"i":18702,"text":"A vertical, split-panel travel poster featuring a photographic view on top and a 3D layered paper-craft illustration of the exact same scene on the bottom.\n\nTop Panel (Realistic Photography): A wide-angle, highly detailed, vibrant photograph of [INSERT LOCATION/SCENERY, e.g., a serene Swiss alpine valley with a modern blue train, a golden autumn forest, or a coastal village]. The lighting is [INSERT LIGHTING STYLE, e.g., warm golden hour light / crisp morning sunlight / bright daytime]. The composition shows [INSERT MAIN SUBJECT/ACTION, e.g., a train curving on tracks / a traveler walking with sheep / a boat sailing].\n\nBottom Panel (Paper-Craft Art): An intricate, multi-layered 3D paper-cut illustration re-creating the exact scene from the photo above. Hand-crafted dimensional paper layers create depth, with visible textured paper edges and shadows. Elements like the background mountains, trees, architecture, and subjects are constructed from distinct colored paper cutouts. The background paper behind the illustration is a warm, textured off-white cream color.\n\nTypography & Layout: Clean, minimalist travel poster design. Elegant dark serif typography for the main title: \"[INSERT TITLE, e.g., Alpine Journey]\". Smaller sans-serif text aligned to the right or side: \"[INSERT SUBTITLES, e.g., SCENIC ROUTE / NATURE / A BRIGHTER TOMORROW]\". Minimalist minimalist captions and thin alignment lines placed on the cream paper background.\n\nExample of how to fill it out:\nLocation/Scenery: a misty bamboo forest in Kyoto with a traditional wooden temple \nLighting Style: soft, diffused morning mist lighting \nMain Subject: a person in a red kimono walking along a stone pathway \nTitle: Bamboo Peace \nSubtitles: KYOTO FOREST / ANCIENT PATH / SERENITY \nThis structure ensures any modern AI image generator understands the split layout, the distinct contrast between the realism on top and the tactile paper-cut art on the bottom, and the specific aesthetic placement of travel typography.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSo5s3jbsAArQri.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSo5s33bYAAW4l6.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSo5s4EbYAEaFka.jpg"]},{"i":18703,"text":"还挺懂我的\n\n这种拼图的图片确实\n\n比单独生出的好看\n\n提示词：\n\n生成一张竖版 9:16、3×3 九宫格照片合集，9 张照片全部为同一位成年女性，保持五官、发型、肤色和身材比例高度一致。\n\n整体主题：KPOP 女团成员的日常工作与私人生活记录，但不是精修营业照，而是一组“拍失败了却意外很有感觉”的手机随手拍。真实、松弛、略狼狈，像手机相册里没有公开过的生活碎片。\n\n9 个画面分别表现不同状态：\n练舞室休息时瘫坐在地板上、后台化妆到一半突然回头、保姆车后排困到睁不开眼、办公室电脑前加班发呆、便利店深夜买东西、回家后窝在沙发上刷手机、浴室镜子前刚洗完头穿宽松居家服、卧室床边整理衣服、清晨刚醒坐在床边喝水。\n\n加入略带私密感但自然的拍摄角度：门缝视角、桌面低机位、床边视角、镜子反射、肩后偷拍感、手机随手举起的歪斜构图。重点是生活距离感，不刻意摆性感姿势。\n\n照片故意保留“失败感”：轻微手抖、运动模糊、对焦偏移、人物被裁掉一点、闭眼瞬间、表情管理失败、头发凌乱、构图歪斜、曝光偶尔过亮、前景遮挡、手机夜景噪点。\n\nKPOP 偶像气质与普通女孩生活形成反差：舞台上精致，私下却困、累、发呆、素颜感、穿宽松卫衣和居家服。冷白室内灯、暖黄卧室灯、城市夜景光混合，iPhone 原相机质感，真实皮肤纹理，不磨皮，不过度美化，不要摄影棚感。\n\n九宫格每格都是不同时间、不同动作、不同机位和不同表情，像连续几天从手机相册随机翻出来的照片。无文字、无水印、无Logo。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSzkSVCboAA2L_H.jpg"]},{"i":18704,"text":"Photo × Line Art | Real-Scene Extension Travel Poster\n\nTransform the uploaded photo into a “Photo × Line Art | Real-Scene Extension Travel Poster.”\n\nThe canvas must use a vertical 2:3 aspect ratio, divided horizontally into two exactly equal 50/50 sections, with the dividing line positioned precisely at the center.\n\nTOP 50% — ORIGINAL PHOTO\n\nUse the original uploaded photograph directly in the upper half.\n\nPreserve the original:\n\n* subjects and people\n* buildings, animals, and objects\n* lighting and colors\n* composition\n* photographic detail and sharpness\n\nDo not redraw, blur, stretch, mirror, duplicate, or arbitrarily alter the photograph.\n\nOnly minimal proportional cropping or natural environmental extension is allowed when necessary to fit the required format.\n\nCONNECTION — PHOTO → LINE ART\n\nAnalyze the original photograph and identify one real visual element that is best suited for extension, such as:\n\nwater, a road, rope, cable, beam of light, bridge, pier, tree branch, mountain slope, architectural contour, mooring post, reflection, or another naturally occurring element.\n\nThis element must begin from its exact position in the original photograph, cross the center dividing line continuously, and gradually transition from realistic photographic texture into simple black line art.\n\nThe extended element must have a clear visual interaction with the small illustrated character in the lower half.\n\nThere must be no gap, misalignment, restart, or disconnected transition at the center line.\n\nThe illustrated character must not feel unrelated to or separate from the photograph.\n\nBOTTOM 50% — MINIMAL LINE ART\n\nUse a clean, neutral warm-white / ivory paper background with an extremely subtle fine-fiber texture.\n\nAdd one small black pen-line character, occupying approximately 7–10% of the total poster height.\n\nCreate an original action based on the content of the photograph. For example, the character may be:\n\npulling, holding, folding, pushing, climbing, observing, walking, resting, or interacting with the extended photographic element in another meaningful way.\n\nThe character should have:\n\n* no clearly defined facial features\n* highly simplified clothing and props\n* thin black pen lines\n* slightly irregular, handmade strokes\n* relaxed and natural linework\n\nHANDWRITTEN PHRASE\n\nBased on the mood and content of the photograph, generate a gentle 2–5 word English phrase.\n\nRender it in small handwritten lettering.\n\nThe phrase should function as a subtle emotional note or poetic caption — not as a main headline.\n\nOVERALL STYLE\n\nThe final result should feel:\n\npremium, restrained, poetic, editorial, minimal, and conceptually clever.\n\nUse the transition between photography and line art as a subtle visual metaphor.\n\nMaintain generous negative space.\n\nFor every new uploaded photograph, create a different connection concept based specifically on that image.\n\nDO NOT\n\nDo not create:\n\n* completely disconnected photo and illustration sections\n* floating characters\n* isolated icons\n* oversized characters\n* detailed facial features\n* chibi or anime characters\n* thick/heavy outlines\n* dense sketching\n* a full line-art recreation of the entire scene\n* infographic-style compositions\n* collage grids\n* postage-stamp elements\n* decorative borders\n* watermarks\n* phone UI elements\n* overly yellow paper\n* oversized typography","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTCXazNacAAWy0C.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTCXa06aoAAucP_.jpg"]},{"i":18705,"text":"Create a high-end cinematic automotive editorial poster featuring a classic 1980s BMW E30 race car as the main subject. The visual style combines underground street racing culture, distressed vintage motorsport graphics, brutalist urban design, and experimental contemporary magazine art.\n\nSUBJECT:\nA heavily modified classic BMW E30 coupe, low and wide stance, aggressive lowered suspension, deep-dish black racing wheels, wide fenders, performance bodywork, front splitter, roll cage visible through the windshield, racing decals and small sponsor stickers, weathered white/off-white paint with scratches, dirt, faded graphics, chipped paint and realistic signs of hard racing use. Keep the BMW proportions and recognizable E30 design extremely accurate. Detailed circular headlights, classic kidney grille, boxy body shape and authentic period-correct details.\n\nVISUAL STYLE:\nRaw 1980s/1990s underground street-racing aesthetic mixed with luxury automotive editorial photography. Distressed screen-print textures, faded ink, rough paper grain, scratched surfaces, photocopy artifacts, torn-poster textures, imperfect registration, subtle halftone patterns, paint splashes, dust, concrete textures and analog film grain.\n\nCOLOR PALETTE:\nMuted cream, dirty white, charcoal black, faded teal, desaturated green, warm beige, burnt orange and selective racing red. Use restrained colors with occasional bold red graphic elements.\n\nCOMPOSITION:\nVertical 4:5 editorial poster composition. The BMW dominates the lower and middle portion of the frame. Use dramatic low camera angles, wide-angle automotive photography, strong perspective, detailed reflections and cinematic depth. Leave enough negative space around the vehicle for oversized graphic typography.\n\nBACKGROUND:\nA dense modern city skyline with tall glass skyscrapers, brutalist architecture, industrial structures, elevated roads and urban streets. Integrate large abstract graphic shapes, painted walls, torn advertisements and oversized typographic elements into the environment. The background should feel like a real city photographed through a distressed analog editorial aesthetic.\n\nTYPOGRAPHY:\nAdd enormous bold condensed sans-serif typography behind and partially around the car. Use fragmented words and abstract letterforms inspired by vintage motorsport posters and experimental Swiss graphic design. Typography should look screen-printed, weathered, partially erased and layered over the architecture. Keep the typography visually integrated rather than clean digital text.\n\nSCENE VARIATION:\nCreate one of these cinematic situations while maintaining the same BMW and visual identity:\n\n1. FRONT HERO SHOT:\n   BMW facing directly toward the camera on a cracked urban road, extremely low front angle, city skyline behind it, enormous faded red typography covering the background, warm late-afternoon sunlight, long shadows and gritty asphalt texture.\n\n2. THREE-QUARTER HERO SHOT:\n   BMW viewed from a dramatic low front three-quarter angle, parked inside or beside a damaged industrial structure, tall skyscrapers visible behind it, broken concrete and large red graphic typography on the wall, soft atmospheric sunlight and heavy film grain.\n\n3. REAR DRIFT SHOT:\n   BMW E30 accelerating away from the camera, rear three-quarter perspective, wide stance and black wheels visible, tires producing smoke and dust, colorful faded racing graphics on the body, large abstract typography behind the car, cinematic sunset light and flying debris.\n\n4. APOCALYPTIC STREET SHOT:\n   BMW facing the camera in the middle of a chaotic urban canyon, surrounded by torn posters, flying paper, broken advertisements, dust and fragments. Tall buildings rise on both sides. Strong central perspective, mostly monochrome environment with selective red and yellow graphic accents, dramatic overcast light and intense motion.\n\nPHOTOGRAPHY:\nUltra-detailed professional automotive photography, 24mm wide-angle lens, low camera position, realistic reflections, realistic tire deformation, physically accurate shadows, cinematic depth, subtle motion blur where appropriate, natural atmospheric haze, 35mm analog film texture, fine grain, slightly faded highlights and rich shadow detail.\n\nTEXTURE:\nExtremely tactile printed-poster appearance. Add aged paper grain, scratches, dust, faded ink, cracked paint, torn edges, imperfect screen printing, subtle chromatic misregistration and distressed photographic textures without making the image look artificially low quality.\n\nMOOD:\nRebellious, nostalgic, raw, urban, underground, cinematic and experimental. The image should feel like a rare vintage motorsport magazine cover discovered decades later, but photographed with modern high-end automotive photography.\n\nQUALITY:\nPhotorealistic BMW, accurate vehicle geometry, realistic materials, realistic city architecture, physically believable lighting, extremely detailed textures, cinematic composition, premium editorial photography, 8K detail, sharp subject, subtle film grain, sophisticated art direction.\n\nAvoid cartoon styling, generic modern cars, futuristic vehicle designs, incorrect BMW proportions, excessive neon, clean digital graphics, plastic-looking surfaces, unrealistic wheels, distorted headlights, malformed typography, excessive HDR, oversaturation and artificial CGI appearance.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTIL8gAboAA74kF.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTIL8igbsAAVtqn.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTIL8f6bEAAvzTE.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTIL8hAbAAA0XY1.jpg"]},{"i":18706,"text":"Use the uploaded photo as the primary reference. Create a vertical 3:4 editorial “photo-to-illustration” composition.\n\nKeep the original photograph in the upper half, preserving the subject, pose, clothing, objects, colors, composition, and recognizable details exactly as much as possible.\n\nTransform the lower half of the image into a delicate hand-drawn storybook illustration that naturally continues the scene from the original photograph. The illustrated section should reinterpret the same subject and key elements in a charming minimalist vintage sketch style, using fine graphite and ink outlines, subtle pencil shading, soft muted colors, light watercolor-like washes, and a warm off-white textured paper background.\n\nMake the transition between the photograph and illustration seamless and artistic, as if the real photograph gradually becomes a children’s storybook drawing. Maintain the same perspective, subject placement, proportions, clothing, accessories, and important objects from the original image.\n\nAdd small imaginative elements that naturally extend the original scene — delicate flowers, plants, clouds, floating objects, subtle environmental details, or whimsical visual storytelling — while keeping the composition elegant and uncluttered.\n\nAesthetic: Japanese/Korean lifestyle illustration, vintage children’s storybook, editorial fashion illustration, soft pencil-and-ink drawing, handmade paper texture, nostalgic, dreamy, minimal, sophisticated.\n\nUse lots of negative space, fine imperfect hand-drawn lines, subtle cross-hatching, gentle pencil texture, understated colors, and a calm poetic atmosphere.\n\nDo not distort the original subject. Do not change the person’s identity, clothing, pose, or main objects. Do not add borders, frames, arrows, labels, or unnecessary graphic elements.\n\nThe final image should look like a real photograph that magically continues into a hand-drawn illustrated storybook scene.\n\nFor the first image specifically\n\nYou can add:\n\nContinue the woman in the gray long-sleeve dress and straw hat into a delicate illustrated version of herself walking through a quiet meadow, carrying a small woven basket filled with flowers. Preserve her long dark hair, gray dress, straw hat, and overall silhouette. Add tiny wildflowers, soft grass, subtle shadows, and handwritten-style poetic text placed naturally in the empty space: “Same hat, new place.”\n\nFor the second image\n\nAdd:\n\nContinue the hand holding the small pink flower into a whimsical illustrated scene where the same pink flower becomes a tiny hot-air balloon carrying a miniature girl or figure upward into the sky. Add delicate hand-drawn clouds, thin strings, soft pencil shading, and subtle grass/landscape elements. Place the handwritten phrase “Just a little higher…” in the empty space.\n\nBest aspect ratio: 3:4 vertical.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTM1by4bcAEAhoP.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTM1by_bYAAi-Ol.jpg"]},{"i":18707,"text":"Create a high-end editorial poster using the uploaded photo as the exact reference, in a strict 3:4 vertical format divided horizontally into two equal 50/50 sections. Preserve the original photo faithfully in the top half, including subjects, identity, pose, clothing, objects, lighting, colors, and realistic texture, with only subtle premium editorial color grading. In the bottom half, reinterpret the most recognizable elements as a small, centered, minimalist handmade paper illustration using delicate imperfect lines, bold flat acrylic-like color shapes, subtle paper grain, organic edges, and no more than 4 colors extracted from the original photo. Keep the illustration only 10–20% of the bottom section with lots of warm off-white negative space and optional minimal editorial typography. The overall result should feel quiet, poetic, refined, artistic, premium, and like an independent art-book cover, avoiding cartoon, watercolor, colored-pencil, 3D, glossy, busy, or commercial aesthetics.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTNOoEQbAAAsAdj.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTNOoERagAAyUWD.jpg"]},{"i":18708,"text":"Use the uploaded food photograph as the primary reference and transform it into a vertical 3:4 editorial art poster while preserving the main food, its appearance, composition, colors, textures, and recognizable details.\n\nKeep the upper half photorealistic, styled like a premium lifestyle/food magazine photograph: natural warm light, soft realistic shadows, elegant composition, authentic food textures, subtle film grain, vintage photography atmosphere, and a sophisticated cozy aesthetic.\n\nIn the lower half, seamlessly transform the main food or a visually important element from the photograph into a whimsical hand-drawn scene or surreal miniature world related to the food. Extend, reshape, or reinterpret the food naturally as part of the illustration. Add one or two tiny human figures interacting with it in a charming, imaginative way. Use delicate imperfect ink linework, minimal vintage sketch style, subtle botanical/details, warm ivory paper texture, and plenty of negative space.\n\nCreate a smooth, creative transition between the realistic photograph and the illustration so they feel like one continuous artwork rather than two separate images. The illustrated scene should tell a simple visual story based on the food and its characteristics.\n\nAdd a short, witty handwritten caption that relates specifically to the food and the illustrated concept. Use small, understated handwritten typography that feels naturally drawn onto the paper.\n\nOverall style: premium editorial food photography + whimsical conceptual illustration + vintage storybook aesthetic + minimalist art direction + warm nostalgic mood.\n\nComposition: vertical 3:4, balanced negative space, realistic upper section, illustrated lower section, seamless transition, refined visual hierarchy.\n\nAvoid: changing the identity of the food, excessive decoration, clutter, large typography, borders, frames, logos, watermarks, harsh dividing lines, cartoonish 3D graphics, overly saturated colors, or an artificial AI-generated appearance.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTXEUtEbQAAI03s.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTXEUt1aYAEG6U4.jpg"]},{"i":18709,"text":"Create a cinematic photorealistic portrait of a young woman sitting inside a dark luxury car at night, viewed from outside through the passenger-side window.\n\nShe has straight copper-red hair with soft bangs framing her forehead, pale natural skin, subtle makeup, and a quiet, thoughtful expression. She rests her chin gently on her hand, looking slightly to the side with a distant, introspective gaze. She wears a beige hooded jacket with the hood pulled over her head, creating a cozy contrast against the dark interior.\n\nThe car has glossy black paint and reflective glass, with the window frame and door cutting diagonally across the composition. Warm amber streetlights and colorful city lights reflect across the glass and car body, creating soft circular bokeh in yellow, orange, green, white, and red. The interior is mostly dark, with subtle warm lighting illuminating her face and hair.\n\nShot from a low outside angle through the car window, intimate close-up framing, slightly off-center composition, realistic reflections and refractions on the glass, shallow depth of field, cinematic night photography, natural skin texture, detailed hair strands, soft atmospheric lighting, deep shadows, moody urban atmosphere, subtle film grain, realistic lens flare, high dynamic range, 85mm lens look, f/1.4, professional cinematic color grading, photorealistic, ultra-detailed.\n\nVertical 9:16 composition, no text, no watermark.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTYaBOybEAAqB6g.jpg"]},{"i":18710,"text":"Please create a separate, independently designed premium poster from each uploaded photo. Do not combine multiple photos into one composition; output one individual poster for each photo. Use a vertical 3:4 composition, with the upper and lower sections strictly divided 1:1, each occupying exactly 50% of the total height.\n\nUpper Half:  \nPreserve the original photograph, maintaining the subject’s identity, structure, pose, realistic texture, natural lighting, and original color atmosphere. Apply only subtle, sophisticated color grading to give it the visual quality of an art magazine, independent publication, or exhibition image. To adapt the image to the 3:4 format, the surrounding background may be naturally extended, but do not stretch, distort, or alter the subject.\n\nLower Half:  \nExtract the most recognizable subject, silhouette, structure, pose, and narrative relationship from the photograph and reconstruct it in the style of Mid-century vernacular graphic illustration + schematic line drawing + two-color spot printing.\n\nDo not completely trace or replicate the photograph. Instead, use diagrammatic abstraction to compress complex objects into a small number of clear geometric shapes, functional contours, and essential structural elements. The result should resemble an illustration from an old instruction manual, advertising card, technical label, or vernacular print: immediately recognizable, yet more direct, humorous, and symbolic than the realistic object itself.\n\nEmphasize economy of line: if a structure can be explained with a single line, do not use unnecessary strokes. Use direct black pen outlines, rectangles, circles, diamonds, straight lines, and simple planes to describe the objects. People, animals, and objects may have slightly exaggerated proportions, while machines, buildings, and complex structures should be simplified into clear boxes, openings, panels, and silhouette relationships.\n\nUse a flat, schematic diagrammatic perspective rather than realistic lighting or strictly accurate spatial depth. The visual language should exist somewhere between illustration and technical diagram, maintaining this distinctive character throughout the composition.\n\nReorganize the composition according to the most important narrative relationship in the original image. Maintain one clear primary subject, while using a small number of supporting objects, guide lines, directional relationships, or structural symbols to reinforce the story.\n\nPay close attention to visual hierarchy, geometric order, scale contrast, positive and negative space, and intentional whitespace. The image may feel slightly naïve, awkward, or handmade in a vernacular way, but it must never feel cluttered. Every visual element should appear to exist for the purpose of “explaining what is happening”, rather than simply serving as decoration.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTcYDu4aoAAf99y.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTcYDvHbwAAOznk.jpg"]},{"i":18711,"text":"A low-angle, close-up photograph capturing a young woman with wavy brown hair outdoors at dusk. She is wearing a grey cropped t-shirt with a blue and white graphic text that reads 'DESTINED' above 'SET 1958' and black denim bottoms. Her head is tilted, and she is looking directly into the camera lens. The dark blue evening sky serves as the background, with silhouetted tree branches visible at the bottom of the frame. Strong flash lighting is directed from the front, illuminating her face and highlighting strands of her hair. The composition has a grainy film photography aesthetic.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTc9-qbW8AAWlfy.jpg"]},{"i":18712,"text":"Create a premium 4:5 vertical modernist editorial travel collage for [COUNTRY / CITY / LOCATION / SUBJECT].\n\nTEXT-TO-IMAGE ONLY — generate the entire artwork creatively from [COUNTRY / CITY / LOCATION / SUBJECT] alone. No reference image required.\n\nCORE CONCEPT\nCreate a sophisticated modernist collage that translates the visual identity of [COUNTRY / CITY / LOCATION / SUBJECT] into bold graphic fragments rather than a realistic scene. Automatically determine the most fitting human figure, animal, environment, clothing, cultural details, and atmosphere.\n\nCOMPOSITION\nPlace the main human figure slightly off-center, occupying roughly one-third of the composition, with a smaller animal nearby. Reduce the surrounding environment into a few symbolic flat shapes rather than realistic depth.\n\nBuild the composition from bold matte-black rectangles, one dominant destination-inspired geometric shape, horizontal bars, thin rules, cropped blocks, small circles, and restrained typographic micro-marks. Allow selected geometric elements to overlap, crop, or partially mask the figure, animal, and scenery.\n\nSCENERY & FORM\nSimplify [COUNTRY / CITY / LOCATION / SUBJECT] into 2–5 instantly recognizable visual motifs—architecture, landscape, transportation, vegetation, objects, or cultural details—using clean cutout-like silhouettes and flat graphic fragments.\n\nSTYLE\nUse warm cream paper as an active background with generous open areas. Combine crisp cut edges, dry ink texture, subtle print grain, slight paper wear, controlled asymmetry, and carefully balanced visual density.\n\nPALETTE\nMatte black, warm cream, one dominant color derived from [COUNTRY / CITY / LOCATION / SUBJECT], one contrasting accent, and one muted supporting tone. Keep colors flat, sophisticated, and restrained.\n\nFINAL AESTHETIC\nModernist editorial collage × contemporary travel graphic × cut-paper abstraction × restrained surrealism × strong geometric hierarchy × sophisticated negative space.\n\nThe result should feel intelligent, artistic, tactile, and collectible, with a strong graphic rhythm rather than a conventional illustration.\n\nAvoid photorealism, realistic atmospheric depth, gradients, 3D rendering, glossy surfaces, excessive detail, clutter, generic icons, excessive typography, logos, watermarks, or symmetrical layouts.\n\nFORMAT: 4:5 vertical, single unified modernist composition.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HThj6nJa0AAcH82.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HThj7WEawAAQrbs.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HThj8JUaoAAZoRp.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HThj87SbsAA1tcN.jpg"]},{"i":18713,"text":"A premium vintage travel poster featuring [Country/City Name] with a large tablet placed in the center displaying a handcrafted 3D papercraft diorama of the destination. The scene seamlessly emerges from the tablet screen into the real world, with colorful paper-cut elements flowing outward. Include iconic landmarks, charming streets, coastal scenery, mountains, flowers, local architecture, traditional culture, regional patterns, native plants, boats, wildlife, and signature foods arranged in an artistic composition.\n\nA realistic hand holding a stylus is actively drawing the artwork, creating the illusion that the destination is coming to life. Around the tablet, decorate the poster with vintage passport stamps, postage stamps, travel sketches, handwritten arrows, illustrated local symbols, maps, botanical drawings, and torn paper textures.\n\nTypography at the top features the destination name in elegant large serif lettering, followed by a refined travel tagline and a smaller subtitle. The poster has warm aged parchment paper, textured paper fibers, soft shadows, layered paper-cut craftsmanship, editorial layout, premium magazine-quality design, subtle depth, cinematic lighting, highly detailed miniature environment, realistic paper textures, elegant composition, luxury tourism campaign aesthetic, handcrafted mixed-media illustration, ultra-realistic, 8K","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HThrAZDakAAlol4.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HThrAY4bMAAKXnv.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HThrAY0acAAq4mO.jpg"]},{"i":18714,"text":"Create a premium 3:4 vertical editorial memory poster for [COUNTRY / CITY / LOCATION / SUBJECT].\n\nTEXT-TO-IMAGE ONLY — generate the entire artwork creatively from [COUNTRY / CITY / LOCATION / SUBJECT] alone. No reference image required.\n\nCORE CONCEPT\nCreate a sophisticated visual diary that combines one realistic destination scene with a playful 3×3 collection of illustrated memory fragments. The artwork should feel like a private travel handbook, independent art publication, or collectible visual diary.\n\nUPPER HALF\nFill the entire upper 50% with a cinematic, highly realistic scene representing [COUNTRY / CITY / LOCATION / SUBJECT]. Automatically select the most recognizable subject, environment, architecture, landscape, people, objects, lighting, and atmosphere associated with the location.\n\nKeep the scene natural and authentic, with refined editorial color grading, realistic textures, natural light, subtle film character, and strong photographic composition.\n\nLOWER HALF\nUse the lower 50% as a warm paper-based illustrated memory board. Extract the most recognizable visual ideas associated with the upper scene and reinterpret them as 9 simplified graphic memory units.\n\nInclude a mixture of:\n• the main subject or silhouette\n• local landmarks or architectural details\n• transportation\n• food or objects\n• plants or nature\n• gestures or human actions\n• cultural details\n• small environmental elements\n• emotional or symbolic details\n\n3×3 MEMORY GRID\nArrange the nine elements using a loose hidden 3×3 grid. The grid should guide the composition without appearing as a rigid table.\n\nAllow each illustration to vary slightly in size, position, angle, and spacing. Keep the arrangement organic, playful, balanced, and intentionally imperfect.\n\nILLUSTRATION STYLE\nUse Naïve Hand-drawn Doodle Illustration with simple slightly awkward forms, trembling outlines, uneven line weight, partially open contours, rough edges, and visible handmade imperfections.\n\nCombine thin black ink lines with colored pencil and crayon textures, small flat color blocks, scattered pigment particles, visible paper grain, white gaps, and unfinished coloring.\n\nDo not realistically redraw the upper scene. Compress its visual information into simple memorable symbols.\n\nTYPOGRAPHY\nAdd one small handwritten title inspired by [COUNTRY / CITY / LOCATION / SUBJECT] near the top of the composition. Add a tiny handwritten caption near the bottom.\n\nSmall decorative elements such as loose wave lines, stars, dots, arrows, or tiny symbols may appear sparingly around the illustrations.\n\nPAPER & COMPOSITION\nUse a warm off-white paper background with subtle physical grain and generous negative space. If any grid indication is visible, make it extremely faint and pencil-like, as though lightly sketched during the design process.\n\nFINAL AESTHETIC\nRealistic travel photography × naïve doodle illustration × 3×3 memory collection × colored-pencil texture × private travel journal × contemporary independent editorial design.\n\nKeep the result loose, cute, restrained, tactile, and highly curated rather than crowded.\n\nAvoid rigid grids, realistic lower-half illustrations, photo duplication, excessive detail, polished vector graphics, glossy digital art, heavy shadows, gradients, clutter, excessive typography, logos, watermarks, or UI elements.\n\nFORMAT: 3:4 vertical, exact 50/50 upper photographic scene and lower illustrated memory collection.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTjbhJvawAAQzmp.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTjbh5xbIAASw-p.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTjbinba4AAYkcw.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTjbjSsbYAAICZi.jpg"]},{"i":18715,"text":"超现实主义 × iPhone快照 × 主题：{XXX}\n\n画布比例：{XXX}，确保主体完整呈现。\n\n核心机制：只对【主题】进行单一、明确、极端的比例或尺度夸张，严格执行指定的“超长”方向；主体结构、材质、功能与识别特征保持稳定。\n\n异常变化为绝对视觉中心，与正常环境尺度形成强烈反差；其他环境元素保持真实尺度。\n\n摄影表现：真实iPhone随手拍摄感，自然生活环境、自然光线、真实曝光、材质与现场细节，轻微偶然构图，非摆拍；避免棚拍、广告、CG与过度精修感。\n\n视觉逻辑：像现实生活中突然被另一台手机记录下来的“不可能瞬间”。整体遵循现实摄影逻辑，超现实感仅来自【主题】的极端尺度变化。\n\n画面要求：主体完整、结构清晰、异常比例一眼可见；保持自然透视与真实空间关系。\n\n默认签名：左下「🔵 DeepBlue」。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTjb4Wxa8AAiH1T.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTjbt3DaMAEzoxo.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTjbt5faoAAWKC5.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTjbt5lbkAAJGLa.jpg"]},{"i":18716,"text":"Create a premium 4:5 vertical vintage editorial travel poster for [COUNTRY / CITY / LOCATION / SUBJECT].\n\nTEXT-TO-IMAGE ONLY — generate the entire artwork creatively from the location or subject alone. No reference image required.\n\nCORE CONCEPT\nDesign a sophisticated collectible travel poster inspired by mid-century American travel advertising, combining a highly detailed illustrated cityscape with oversized luxury editorial typography and subtle vintage print textures.\n\nCOMPOSITION\nPlace the destination name prominently across the upper section in enormous elegant high-contrast serif typography, allowing the letters to interact naturally with the skyline. Highlight selected letters with a warm ochre/golden accent while keeping the remaining typography deep charcoal black.\n\nBelow the typography, create a richly illustrated panoramic scene automatically based on the most recognizable visual identity of [COUNTRY / CITY / LOCATION / SUBJECT]. Feature its most iconic landmark or architectural element as the dominant focal point, supported by secondary buildings, bridges, streets, waterfronts, mountains, monuments, or cultural details that genuinely belong to the destination.\n\nAdd a subtle vintage sun disk, atmospheric clouds, distant silhouettes, and natural environmental details where appropriate. The scene should feel expansive, elegant, and carefully composed rather than crowded.\n\nEDITORIAL DETAILS\nInclude small refined destination information around the typography:\n— region/state/country\n— recognizable secondary landmarks\n— approximate coordinates\n— one or two short location descriptors\n\nKeep these details understated and typographically balanced. Automatically determine appropriate information from the destination.\n\nVISUAL STYLE\nMid-century travel poster × engraved architectural illustration × vintage editorial design × refined American tourism print.\n\nUse finely detailed ink and engraving-style linework, delicate crosshatching, halftone textures, slightly imperfect print registration, subtle paper grain, and restrained hand-printed imperfections.\n\nCOLOR PALETTE\nWarm ivory paper background, charcoal black, muted architectural gray, dusty blue or destination-specific atmospheric tones, and one strong ochre/golden accent. Automatically adapt the accent colors to the character of the destination while preserving the vintage print aesthetic.\n\nTYPOGRAPHY\nLarge elegant high-contrast serif display type, sophisticated editorial spacing, oversized lettering, restrained secondary sans-serif or serif information, strong hierarchy, and generous negative space.\n\nFINAL AESTHETIC\nA premium museum-shop travel poster that feels collectible, timeless, architectural, sophisticated, slightly nostalgic, and authentically printed on aged ivory paper.\n\nAvoid photorealism, glossy digital rendering, modern gradients, excessive colors, generic landmarks, cluttered layouts, cartoon styling, excessive text, logos, watermarks, UI elements, and contemporary advertising aesthetics.\n\nFORMAT\n4:5 vertical composition, highly detailed, sharp architectural linework, balanced negative space, premium print quality, cohesive typography and illustration.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTmkOGAacAASQ0L.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTmkPEVbwAALXSa.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTmkP7MbYAA5Odr.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTmkQx8a4AAulsG.jpg"]},{"i":18717,"text":"Create a premium 4:5 vertical photorealistic miniature diorama for [FOOD / OBJECT / SUBJECT].\n\nTEXT-TO-IMAGE ONLY — generate the entire scene creatively from [FOOD / OBJECT / SUBJECT] alone. No reference image required.\n\nCORE CONCEPT\nTransform the outer form of [FOOD / OBJECT / SUBJECT] into a tiny, realistic architectural world. Keep the recognizable natural exterior, texture, color, shape, and material of the subject, while revealing a charming miniature interior hidden inside it.\n\nCOMPOSITION\nShow the subject as a partially opened miniature structure, with one clearly visible opening or cutaway that allows the viewer to look directly inside. The exterior should remain unmistakably recognizable as the original subject.\n\nInside, create a fully furnished miniature space inspired by the character of the subject and its visual identity. Automatically determine the most fitting room or environment — such as a tiny library, studio, café, workshop, bedroom, shop, greenhouse, or other imaginative interior.\n\nMake the interior feel physically built inside the subject, not like a separate room placed next to it. Include tiny furniture, shelves, books, objects, warm practical lighting, and carefully scaled architectural details.\n\nMATERIAL CONTRAST\nCreate a strong tactile contrast between the exterior material of [FOOD / OBJECT / SUBJECT] and the interior construction. The outside should retain its authentic organic or physical texture, while the inside can use miniature wood, painted surfaces, fabric, paper, ceramic, or other appropriate materials.\n\nDETAIL & SCALE\nEmphasize the dramatic difference between the full-sized exterior form and the tiny furniture inside. Show realistic material transitions, thickness at the cut edge, small imperfections, believable construction, and intricate miniature details.\n\nLIGHTING & STYLE\nWarm cinematic miniature photography, soft evening illumination, subtle shadows, shallow depth of field, realistic macro perspective, highly detailed textures, calm cozy atmosphere, premium handcrafted diorama aesthetic.\n\nBACKGROUND\nUse a simple warm cream or neutral studio background so the miniature structure remains the sole focus.\n\nFINAL AESTHETIC\nPhotorealistic miniature architecture × surreal object transformation × handcrafted diorama × cozy interior design × macro photography × tactile material realism.\n\nAvoid people, floating objects, unrealistic proportions, generic containers, plastic-looking textures, excessive decoration, multiple separate scenes, text, logos, watermarks, split-screen layouts, or collage effects.\n\nFORMAT\n4:5 vertical, single cohesive composition, close 3/4 perspective, interior clearly visible, highly detailed, photorealistic, premium editorial quality.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTn6CNla0AAoKdw.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTn6C2fa0AA__Z2.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTn6DgAbMAAcfQo.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTn6ENSaMAA-ZGe.jpg"]},{"i":18718,"text":"90年代中国生活影像 × 彩色胶片快照 ×\n主题：【XXX】\n\n随机元素：随机场景、随机人物、随机服装、随机动作与表情、随机实验镜头与构图。\n\n视觉关键词：旧公交、录像厅、旧书店、街边摊、磁带、VCD、旧广告牌。\n\n气质：真实、偶然、生活化、未经摆拍、怀旧。\n\n主题角色的性格、身份与人物关系，自然转译为90年代中国城市生活中的人物状态。服装、行为、环境符合真实90年代生活逻辑。\n\n每张独立随机抽取，互不继承；分别独立成像，不拼图、不宫格、不分屏。2:3竖幅。左下签名「🔵 DeepBlue」。\n\nn=6","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTpHmFebAAAcym0.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTpHmKsaIAAwKt2.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTpHmKxbwAA1Fuy.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTpHtiHaEAALDpG.jpg"]},{"i":18719,"text":"之一\n\n完整提示词：\n\n```\n围绕任意主题对象生成一枚手写字形主视觉：把主题名称、核心符号或关键信息压缩成少数字形单元，整体集中在画面中心区域，四周保留大量安静空白，让第一眼先读到厚重黑形，再读到内部细线的手工速度。主形体使用粗黑笔触构成，边缘保留手写时的轻微歪斜、断口、墨量不均和切割感，笔画不要圆润修饰；其中一个主要字形或符号被处理成外框厚重、内部由多条水平细线拉紧填充的结构，细线长短略有差异，像被压缩的层叠纹理，形成粗块与细线、实墨与空隙之间的张力。背景作为高明度干净底场，面积占绝大多数，通风感明确；色彩从主题自身的材质、情绪和文化语义中提取，但遵循大面积明亮洁净底色、少量高对比结构色、极少强调色的角色映射，保持清透安静、明度高、饱和度受控、边界清楚，深色只承担信息和骨架重量，不把画面做旧、做脏或变成复古纸感。整体呈现像一次快速但有判断的手绘字体实验，信息少、力度集中、空白有压迫感，完成品应有真实毛边和笔触停顿，而不是印刷字体、装饰花纹或普通书法。\n\n——————\n主题：独立书店阅读活动的主题字形主视觉，传达安静、亲近且具有文化感的活动气质\n补充：出现 3 个相关信息点\n画幅：竖版 9:10\n```","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTq83kmbAAAUvRu.jpg"]}];